    "这条会立即批准；以后「%@」的写入将直接通过，不再逐条询问。规则可以在枢纽「审批规则」里随时撤销。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条会立即批准；以后「%@」的写入将直接通过，不再逐条询问。规则可以在枢纽「审批规则」里随时撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條會立即批准；以後「%@」的寫入將直接通過，不再逐條詢問。規則可以在樞紐「審批規則」裡隨時撤銷。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This one will be approved immediately. From now on, writes to “%@” will pass directly without asking each time. You can revoke the rule anytime in the Hub under Approval Rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
