    "提醒：这是公网明文地址，令牌等于这台电脑的钥匙，明文传输有被截获的风险；建议用私网地址或带 https 的地址。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒：这是公网明文地址，令牌等于这台电脑的钥匙，明文传输有被截获的风险；建议用私网地址或带 https 的地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提醒：這是公網明文位址，權杖等於這台電腦的鑰匙，明文傳輸有被截獲的風險；建議用私網位址或帶 https 的位址。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Note: this is a public plain-text address. The token is effectively the key to this computer, and sending it in plain text risks interception. Use a private-network address or an https address instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
