            "value": "裝置工作階段目前未連接：智慧代理現在叫不到這台手機；回到 App 前景、工作階段恢復在線後才可呼叫。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The device session isn't connected right now: the agent can't reach this phone. Calls become possible once you bring the app to the foreground and the session is back online."
          }
        }
      }
    },
