    "这条是对账时补记的：它开始时台账还没记上。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条是对账时补记的：它开始时台账还没记上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條是對帳時補記的：它開始時臺帳還沒記上。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This entry was backfilled during reconciliation — the ledger hadn't recorded it when it started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这条记录已不在，时间线读不到。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这条记录已不在，时间线读不到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這條記錄已不在，時間軸讀不到。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This record no longer exists, so its timeline can't be read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "伴生服务还没有台账功能。等它升级后，这里会自动开始记录每件工作的进度。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伴生服务还没有台账功能。等它升级后，这里会自动开始记录每件工作的进度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
