            "value": "被呼叫時現讀現回；你開啟「資料同步」後，過去 30 天到未來 90 天的行程清單（不含備註）會存一份在你自己的伺服器上供智慧代理查詢，可隨時關掉並刪除。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read live when called. Once you turn on Data Sync, the schedule list from the past 30 days to the next 90 days (without notes) is kept on your own server for the agent to query — you can turn it off and delete it anytime."
