            "value": "未检测到伴生服务，动态、点子、台账暂时不可用。请在服务器上确认伴生服务已经启动，启动后回到这个页面会自动重新检测。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未偵測到伴生服務，動態、點子、臺帳暫時無法使用。請在伺服器上確認伴生服務已經啟動，啟動後回到這個頁面會自動重新偵測。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No companion service was detected, so Feed, Ideas and the work ledger are unavailable for now. Make sure the companion service is running on your server — this page checks again automatically when you come back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
