            "value": "Single-shot on-device answers · supported models only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回答在这台手机上生成，不联网、不出手机；一次能处理的文字量有限，太长会如实报错。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答在这台手机上生成，不联网、不出手机；一次能处理的文字量有限，太长会如实报错。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回答在這台手機上生成，不連網、不出手機；一次能處理的文字量有限，太長會如實報錯。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answers are generated on this phone — no network, nothing leaves the device. Each request handles a limited amount of text; overly long input reports an honest error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本人确认": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本人确认"
