          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按名運行一條快捷指令"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run a shortcut by name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能按名运行、不能枚举你的快捷指令；运行中你会离开 OneDay 一阵，回来之后才有结果。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
